  "acceptance": [
    "Strict shared version1 envelope reuses existing schemaVersion/requestId. Optional clientSeq is bounded0..2147483647; forged actor/role/server/path fields and invalid bounds rejected, while old command JSON and chat strictness remain intact.",
    "Fresh sequenced seat/move/leave commands enforce monotonic ordering after current authorization/context/receipt checks inside the existing queue. Concurrent duplicates and old matching receipts do not reapply effects; changed action/payload or stale/equal fresh sequences conflict.",
    "Actual per-tab/rejoin/reconnect/new-membership, validation failure/no-consumption, snapshot resync, movement and projection-loss cases pass. Real deferred travel COMMIT compensation preserves the source watermark and seat; current higher sequence works afterwards.",
    "Fresh protocol/integration coverage preserves seat/order/reward/travel uniqueness, committed-effect-before-ACK, session revoke/block/privacy and real PG/socket/owner-failure invariants. Existing durable modules, global serialization/advisory owner, SQL and safety defaults are unchanged.",
    "Implemented test:protocol before executing it; existing full integration/security coverage retained. Actual diagnostic snapshots are isolated and hash-indexed; initial expected contract failure retained."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Optional client ordering is not an authorization boundary or exactly-once delivery. Legacy inputs omit it; no product client begins sending it and N/N−1 capability negotiation remains N05-06.",
    "Room receipts are bounded five-minute in-memory history; owner changes require fresh membership/resync. Global queue/snapshot-carrying delta and singleton guard are retained, without distributed fencing or production capacity claims.",
    "The128-case focused protocol run precedes one added action-binding case and diagnostic output migration; dedicated action-binding/type/lint and final full integration cover final refinements. Overlapping suites are reported separately, not summed as unique tests.",
    "Focused security command is not repeated because all its selected files remain in the actual complete integration gate. Initial new-field contract assertion failed as expected and is preserved.",
    "No fresh full browser, production image release, hosted workflow/GHCR, external staging, physical device, store/public/adult/media/operator authorization. Known hosted Deadline cadence failure/enforcement403 remain unresolved.",
    "Private raw diagnostic/log evidence is local until owner cleanup, not off-host archived; N13/N14 remain inactive."
  ],
